title: "KG2-LLM: Learning Tracking and Resource Recommendation Fusing Dual Knowledge Graphs and Large Language Models"
abstract: "Reference implementation and self-built dataset for dual knowledge-graph + LLM personalized learning tracking and resource recommendation, including 11 knowledge-tracing baselines under a unified fair-tuning protocol."
